  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>On comparing both sides we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;,</p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
